?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Start from your goal and let the AI draft the plan, or build engagements directly. The point is to be running real work the same day, not setting up for weeks.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What happens after the free trial?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can keep your firm on Workspace at $9 per seat/month, and add Client Space at $19 per client whenever you want a client portal, or bundle both for $24.99/month. See the pricing page for what each plan includes.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you help with onboarding and support?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Every plan includes support. Enterprise adds dedicated onboarding and migration, a named account manager, and a custom SLA.\"}}]}]}c:X\n11:X\n11:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"s-SzrJik84r4n8PmDm1tJ\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],\"$L3\",\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"],[\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\"],\"$La\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@b\",\"staleTime\":\"$c\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Ld\",\"isPartial\":\"$@e\",\"staleTime\":\"$c\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lf\",\"isPartial\":\"$@10\",\"staleTime\":\"$c\",\"varyParams\":\"$11\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L12\",\"isPartial\":\"$@13\",\"staleTime\":\"$c\",\"varyParams\":null}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@14\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@15\"}\n16:I[62319,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0ht-3v40sanoo.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1_7yxp1yolfg7.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1_p0c8_mtfqqv.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/41mnvtr75by45.js\"],\"Navbar\"]\n17:I[59095,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0ht-3v40sanoo.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1_7yxp1yolfg7.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1_p0c8_mtfqqv.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/41mnvtr75by45.js\"],\"Reveal\"]\n18:I[67530,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0ht-3v40sanoo.js\",\"/_next/static/chunk